                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f545fc41-4893-45e5-8603-db30b73002ae",
                                                "sense_id": "9f91f538-50f0-3d80-98c5-29b7169702cf",
                                                "text": "There are moments when the brightest minds prefer the soothings of sympathy to all the brilliance of wit, as he that is in need of repose, selects a bed of feathers, rather than of flints."
